raw_text = "~ setup
Dispatcher: I'm the dispatcher in Sparta. I'll be your primary contact while you track down the suspect.
Dispatcher: Now that you've deployed your agents, I will inform you of anything we learn about the suspect's movements.
do GlobalVars.sus_moves_first.emit()
=> END

~ susmovefirst
Dispatcher: We have a report that {{GlobalVars.sus_name}} is on the move. We don't know the suspect's location, but we know it was by {{GlobalVars.sus_last_move_type}}.
Dispatcher: I am sure we will get the suspect's location from time to time. When that happens, I'll share that with you. Until then, move your agents to best locate the suspect.
=> END

~ susmove
if GlobalVars.sus_last_move_type == \"special\"
	Dispatcher: [[The suspect has moved|{{GlobalVars.sus_name}} is on the move]]. However, we can't determine the mode of travel.
else
	Dispatcher: [[The suspect has moved|{{GlobalVars.sus_name}} is on the move]], traveling by {{GlobalVars.sus_last_move_type}}.
=> END

~ susreveal
Dispatcher: [[We have located {{GlobalVars.sus_name}}.|{{GlobalVars.sus_name}} has been spotted.|We have the suspect's location.]]  [[Move your agents in quickly to intercept.|We won't have {{GlobalVars.sus_name}} in our sights for long.]]
=> END

~ suslost
Dispatcher: [[The suspect has vanished.|{{GlobalVars.sus_name}} has slipped away.|We lost track of {{GlobalVars.sus_name}}.]]
=> END

~ footmoves2
Dispatcher: Be careful, {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}. You are running low on moves by foot.  If you run out of foot moves, you may no longer be able to participate in this mission.
=> END

~ footmoves1
Dispatcher: You have only one remaining move by foot, {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}. If you run out of foot moves, you may no longer be able to participate in this mission.
=> END

~ doublemove
Dispatcher: We just got word that the suspect is on the move [wave]again![/wave]
=> END

~ setuphelp
Dispatcher: Deploy your agents around Sparta to create the best chance of capturing the suspect.
- Got it.
- I changed my mind. I have better things to do.
	Dispatcher: [[You're quitting now? We're just getting started. Well, okay.|Okay, but the Chief isn't going to be happy.|I understand. Police work is hard.]]
	do GlobalVars.quit.emit()
=> END

~ gamehelp
%3 Dispatcher: What do you need?
%3 Dispatcher: How can I help?
% Dispatcher: Yes, I'd like one large pepperoni, an antipasto for two, and ... oh, wait, sorry, wrong line. It's you. [wave]Ahem[/wave] ... How can I help?
- What is the status of the suspect?
	if GlobalVars.sus_reveal_turn.has(GlobalVars.turn_number) :
		Dispatcher: The suspect is spotted at {{GlobalVars.sus_last_location_description}}.
	else :
		Dispatcher: We don't yet have a location for {{GlobalVars.sus_name}}. [if GlobalVars.sus_last_location_description == \"\"]The suspect has not yet been spotted anywhere in Sparta.[/if] [if GlobalVars.sus_last_location_description != \"\"]The suspect was last seen at location {{GlobalVars.sus_last_location_description}}.[/if] Since then, we have tracked movements by {{GlobalVars.sus_mode_since_reveal}}.
- Has there been any recent wild animal sighting?
	if GlobalVars.wild_animal_last_turn_spotted == 0
		%3 Dispatcher: No, I have not heard any reports of wild animal sightings.
		% Dispatcher: Well, it depends on your definition of \"wild\". I see a rabbit out the window, and a few birds, but if you're talking about bears, then no.
	else
		Dispatcher: The last bear sighting we received was on move {{GlobalVars.wild_animal_last_turn_spotted}} in the {{GlobalVars.wild_animal_last_section_spotted}} section of town.
- I need to quit.
	Dispatcher: [[You're quitting now? We're just getting started. Well, okay.|Okay, but the Chief isn't going to be happy.|I understand. Police work is hard.]]
	do GlobalVars.quit.emit()
=> END

~ wild_animal_spotted
% Dispatcher: A bear has been spotted in the {{GlobalVars.wild_animal_section}} section.
=> END
"
metadata/dialogue_manager_version = "3.10.4"
